    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "main",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "main",
        "tabindex": "-1"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "intro",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero",
            "style": "min-height:auto; padding-top:60px;"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-eyebrow"
              },
              "html": "An evening together · At home · Adults 18+"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "page-title"
              },
              "html": "A romantic date night at home, <br>\n<em>with a voice to guide you.</em>\n"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-sub"
              },
              "html": "For your next night together, choose an activity with room for how you both feel. With Caresse, start with a free demo and, if the format suits you, create guided audio fiction around your preferences."
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "store-controls"
              },
              "html": "\n<div class=\"cta-group\">\n<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download now</a>\n</div>\n"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-badge"
              },
              "html": "Free demos · No Caresse account · Personalized sessions with paid credits, no subscription."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "intent"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Three simple moments for your evening"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "intent-prose"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Dinner, soft lighting, a chance to catch up: start with what you enjoy together. An audio experience can then bring something new to your evening."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "For a shared listen, a phone with a speaker is enough. Choose a comfortable spot where you can hear the voice clearly, then set the volume before you begin."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "diff"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title",
                "id": "configuration-title"
              },
              "html": "An evening idea you can adapt together"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "diff-table-wrap"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "table",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "diff-table",
                    "aria-labelledby": "configuration-title"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Before listening</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">Time to talk about what you both want</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>To explore</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">A free demo in the app</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>To personalize</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">Duo mode, your names and a romantic atmosphere</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Afterwards</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">A moment to share what you enjoyed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "intent-prose",
                "style": "max-width:900px;margin:32px auto 0;"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The demo is free. For a session with your names and preferences, choose duo mode and generate it with a paid credit, with no subscription."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "This is an idea for an evening, not a timed program in the app. Generation time and audio duration can vary, so choose a moment when you do not need to finish at an exact time."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "how"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Turn the idea into time together"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "steps-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div>\n<h3>Share the idea</h3>\n<p>Suggest a voice-guided experience for your next evening together. A demo lets you discover the tone and atmosphere together.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div>\n<h3>Find a starting point</h3>\n<p>Install the app, listen to a demo and discuss it. To create a session, choose duo mode and preferences you both feel comfortable with.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div>\n<h3>Get comfortable together</h3>\n<p>Once the audio is ready, play it on your phone or speaker. The voice accompanies your evening with a story created from your choices.</p>\n"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Three ways to make the evening your own"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefits-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>A gentle evening</h3>\n<p>A calm, romantic atmosphere can make an ordinary evening feel special. The preferences you choose together set the tone of the session.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>Room for surprise</h3>\n<p>You choose the direction of the experience without reading the whole story in advance. The narration is generated from your setup and varies with each creation.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>Every couple, with everyone’s consent</h3>\n<p>All adult couples are welcome, whatever each person’s gender or sexual orientation. Every activity requires free, mutual consent throughout the evening. Consent can be withdrawn at any time.</p>\n"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq",
            "aria-labelledby": "faq-title"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "faq-title",
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Your questions, answered."
            },
            {
              "type": "faq",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-list"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Can we try this evening idea without paying?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "You can download Caresse and listen to free demos without buying a credit. If you decide to create a personalized session from your profiles, that generation is paid."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Is it only for new couples?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Couples who are getting to know each other and those who have shared their lives for years can try this audio activity. Start with what you want to discover together."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Do we need exactly thirty minutes?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Generation time and audio length vary. Leave room in your evening rather than planning to the minute."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Do I need a Caresse account to buy credits?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Anonymous mode lets you use Caresse without creating a Caresse account. Purchases still require your Apple or Google account and its payment method on the store you use."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Which audio languages are available?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. Demos are in French, English and Spanish. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "aside",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "editorial-links",
            "aria-label": "Further reading",
            "style": "max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 5%;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.7;"
          },
          "html": "\n<p>Further reading : <a href=\"/en/blog/first-intimate-audio-experience-together/\" style=\"color:var(--primary-vibrant);text-underline-offset:3px;\">A guide to your first intimate audio experience together</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"seasonal-links\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">For a special occasion: <a href=\"/en/relationship-anniversary/\" style=\"color:var(--primary);text-underline-offset:3px;\">A wedding or civil partnership anniversary</a> · <a href=\"/en/valentines-day-at-home/\" style=\"color:var(--primary);text-underline-offset:3px;\">Valentine’s Day at home</a> · <a href=\"/en/christmas-date-nights/\" style=\"color:var(--primary);text-underline-offset:3px;\">Christmas date nights</a>.</p>\n"
        },
